:51:42Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T14:51:42Z","body":"Did some testing and at first it seemed like we could skip doing this step thanks to addr2line doing its own fetching of the debug symbols, but some more detailed testing showed that this was not universal and unfortunately the cargo one doesn't seem to support it directly, so it's safe to say that we cannot rely on the addr2line program having that support, especially across platforms\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5440901891/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6083170965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122764#issuecomment-6083170965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122764","id":6083170965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABapXSlQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T14:41:58Z","updat